# DeepStack artifact licensing

This repository is a mixed-license distribution.

## Open-source components

Except for the binary components, third-party files, and licensing materials
identified below, the source code, artifact runners, scripts, documentation,
manifests, and data in this repository are licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The complete text is in `LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt`.

This scope notice, `LICENSING.md`, the controlling texts under `LICENSES/`,
and adjacent `.so.license` files are licensing materials rather than part of
the Apache-licensed work. They may be reproduced verbatim as required or
permitted by their respective terms.

## Proprietary binary components

The following precompiled components are proprietary software and are not
licensed under Apache-2.0:

- `src/deepstack/mosaic/arch/_reference_model*.so`
- `src/deepstack/mosaic/cost/_capacity*.so`
- `src/deepstack/mosaic/noc/_model_support*.so`
- `src/tilesight/tilesight/distributed/noc/_model_support*.so`

They are licensed solely under
`LICENSES/LicenseRef-DeepStack-AE-Binary-1.0.txt`. Each released binary has an
adjacent `.license` file carrying its SPDX scope marker.

Source code for these binaries and separately usable calibration materials
are not provided. No separate rights in the binaries' embedded proprietary
materials are granted except for the limited rights expressly stated in the
binary license.

## Third-party components

Third-party files remain subject to their respective licenses and notices.
See `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` and the license headers in those files.
